<title>USA: US Senate bank panel to hold Yellen hearing Feb 5.</title>
<headline>US Senate bank panel to hold Yellen hearing Feb 5.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Senate Banking Committee said Wednesday it will hold a confirmation hearing on February 5 on Janet Yellen's nomination to head the Council of Economic Advisers.</p>
<p>The hearing on Yellen, a Federal Reserve governor, will be held at 1000 EST/1500 GMT, the committee said.</p>
<p>The panel must approve the nomination before it is sent to the full Senate for a vote.</p>
</text>
